flowchart TD

    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(開始刪除商品操作)
    ClickDeleteButton(點擊刪除商品按鈕)
    PopUpDeleteDoubleConfirm(彈出刪除商品雙重確認視窗)
    ClickConfirmButton(點擊確認按鈕)
    ClickCancelButton(點擊取消按鈕)
    RequestToDeleteProductAPI(發送刪除商品請求)
    IsSuccess{是否刪除成功}
    PopUpFailed(彈出刪除失敗視窗)
    RefreshTable(重新整理Table)
    EndPoint(刪除商品操作完成)

    StartPoint --> ClickDeleteButton
    ClickDeleteButton --> PopUpDeleteDoubleConfirm
    PopUpDeleteDoubleConfirm --> ClickConfirmButton
    ClickConfirmButton --> RequestToDeleteProductAPI
    RequestToDeleteProductAPI --> IsSuccess
    IsSuccess -->|是| RefreshTable
    IsSuccess -->|否| PopUpFailed
    PopUpFailed --> EndPoint
    RefreshTable --> EndPoint
    StartPoint --> ClickCancelButton
    ClickCancelButton --> EndPoint
